ary, true shear HS invariance, genuine homogeneous-initial HS equality and original/formal jet transfer proves ALL normalized HS values equal the ORIGINAL J values. No fixed-coordinate diagram inclusion, original/source-profile equality, target standardness or HS certificate is assumed.",
